      "with": ["ingredient/water", "ingredient/lemon-juice", "ingredient/olive-oil", "ingredient/vine-leaf"],
      "text": "Pack the rolls seam down and close together in a pot lined with a few torn leaves. Add the {water}, the rest of the {lemon} and the rest of the {oil}, set a plate on top to hold them down and put on the lid. Simmer gently until the {rice} is soft and the leaves are tender, then leave them to cool in the pot.",
      "time": {"from": 40, "to": 50, "unit": "minute"},
